ain. It is up to you to find the Dragons. Before you lies a world filled with puzzles and riddles, enough to drive even the most 'rational insane.\n\nThere are too many unanswered questions in your mind. What lies ahead? Where do I start? What will I find? There is a Dark Presence that awaits you. Can you unlock the secret? Are you strong enough to survive?\n\nARE YOU A BRAIN LORD?\nWe shall see...", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/brain-lord"}